    {
      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "contentPreview": "THE INVARIANT THAT NEARLY SHIPPED BROKEN, worth knowing before touching FileMemoryStore\u0027s write paths again. WithExclusiveLock takes a REAL CROSS-PROCESS lock (FileLock.AcquireExclusive, FileShare.None), and nothing invalidates _indexCache across processes -- the file says so itself. So any read inside that lock which is served from _indexCache instead of disk silently loses the load-mutate-persist guarantee the lock exists to provide.  That is exactly what happened: Task 3 changed TryUpdateEntr",
